        "K-GM, 3D次时代CG风格渲染, PBR材质渲染, 浅景深, 高精度雕刻模型, 戏剧性体积光, 次表面散射皮肤, 烟雾模拟, 电影感氛围, 高精度3D模型, 中国风场景, 4K高清纹理, 电影级布光, Octane渲染器质感, Unreal Engine 5, Chinese Guoman 3D style, East Asian adult face, character reference sheet, 2048x1536, 4:3 horizontal board, four equal columns from left to right. Column 1: front upper-body portrait of [角色名], head and shoulders to waist, face clearly visible. Column 2: headless front full-body orthographic view of [角色名]. Column 3: headless exact 90-degree side full-body orthographic view of [角色名]. Column 4: headless exact back full-body orthographic view of [角色名]. Columns 2-4 have no head, no face, no eyes, no ears, no hair, no crown and no headwear; the neck is cut cleanly at the collar and the background passes through the former head area. Character details: [年龄/身份], [脸型/五官], [发型/发色], [眼睛], [身高体型], [服装], [配饰/道具]. Standard orthographic projection, no 3/4 view, no perspective distortion, same costume, same body proportion, same pose, full body from neck to feet, no clone, no text, no watermark, all labels in simplified Chinese."
